plot-go reads and renders the project file format of Grace (xmgrace), a
separate program distributed under the GNU GPL, version 2 or later. It is
an independent implementation written from the file format and Grace's
documentation; it contains no Grace source code. Grace's own gracebat is
used only as an external reference in tests.

The standard PDF fonts plot-go refers to (Times-Roman, Helvetica, Symbol)
are named, not embedded; the viewer supplies them.

internal/afm/adobe-core14/ holds Adobe's Core 14 AFM font metric files,
unmodified, with Adobe's MustRead.html, which permits their use, copying
and distribution for any purpose provided that file accompanies them:
